name = "Trench Dream Drops"
description = "What the Sentinel carries up from past the squeeze line. The pearl it grows around is the trench's own dream: whoever wears it hears the squeeze line loosen. The ores are the garden's debris caught in its kelp net -- the deep grades, shed honestly."
